      <rules>
        <rule id="de4b-dec2-7e20-c761" name="Bolter Drill" hidden="false">
          <description>You may re-roll the to hit dice for any bolter fire undertaken by a squad led by Lysander. If you do then you must re-roll all the to hit dice, not just the ones that missed. You may only re-roll boltgun dice, not bolt pistols or heavy bolters, etc.</description>
        </rule>
