        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="36a3-4172-b73c-0e63" name="Major Psychic Power" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="0dd4-78bd-4f7a-1fba" type="min"/>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="5fa0-b988-625d-2b0e" type="max"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="112b-9f7b-2b1f-ebd1" name="Smite" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="e852-5d20-1187-2921" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="a93d-f43b-2343-428f" name="Smite" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Lethal bolts of lightning leap from the Librarian&apos;s gauntlets, tearing his enemies apart and incinerating even the most heavily armoured targets in a barrage of psychic power.
This power is used in the Shooting phase instead of firing a weapon and uses a weapon profile of the same name.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink id="a8bd-1ef7-b6f2-663e" name="Smite" hidden="false" targetId="c4fd-c9a0-298c-1f66" type="profile"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="67d5-7bc6-05ad-93ac" name="Fury of the Ancients" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="d54d-800c-ccd0-db9f" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="08cf-70bd-afa1-e848" name="Fury of the Ancients" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">The Librarian draws on the ancient legends of this Chapter ot create a ravening beast of pellucid flame and psychic energy. The psychic construct charges forward, burning all in its path and leaving a trail of destruction in its wake.
This power is used in the Librarian&apos;s Shooting phase instead of firing a weapon. Choose a point on any table edge, the psychic construct will move in a straight line from the Librarian to this point. Every unit in its path will suffer D3 Strength 5, Ap- hits and must take a Pinning test. If the construct would hit a friendly unit or a unit locked in close combat it will dissipate just before the impact and has no further effect.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="3.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="1ab9-4e50-94d6-951d" name="Fear of the Darkness" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="03f7-d114-afdb-144b" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="c538-7613-2e66-ec49" name="Fear of the Darkness" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Summoning the indescribable malice of the Warp, the Libarian unleashes a mighty wave of sheer terror, piercing every creature&apos;s soul with the horror of death and revealing their utter insignificance in the face of an uncaring universe.
This power is used in the Librarian&apos;s Shooting phase instead of firing a weapon. Every enemy unit within 12&quot; of the Libarian not locked in close combat must take a Morale check with a -2 modifier as if suffering 25% casualties from a shooting attack.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="5.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="fb87-4a14-99b5-9b56" name="Might of Heroes" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="3d72-d145-2cec-4c8e" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="4e5a-be18-90be-2b44" name="Might of Heroes" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">The deadly powers of the immaterium flow into the Librarian, heightening his speed and strength to unimaginable levels to better smite the foes of the Emperor.
This power is used at the start of either player&apos;s Assault phase. One model in the Libarians unit gains +D3 attacks in that Assault phase.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="5.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="48d5-61ee-4d16-318f" name="Veil of Time" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="2c01-058c-9cfb-fea3" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="c63e-ef8e-44f0-4539" name="Veil of Time" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">The Librarian steps out of phase with the passage of time, able to witness the myriad potential futures and trace their origins back to the present. Armed with such knowledge, a Librarian can alter the course of events to avoid or create the future.
This power is used at the start of the Movement phase and lasts until the end of the Space Marine turn. The Librarian may choose to re-roll any rolls to hit, to wound, Armour Saves, Invulnerable Saves, Leadership tests or Morale checks.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="10.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="4861-7af5-4981-b1a6" name="Vortex of Doom" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="1317-9125-700b-ff2f" type="max"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="b394-57fd-e835-1469" name="Vortex of Doom" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Opening a tear between the material realm and the howling destruction of the Warp, the Librarian&apos;s enemies are destroyed by the twisting energies unleashed. But such power comes at a price, and to lose control of it, even for a moment, is to invite terrible consequence.
This power is used in the Librarian&apos;s Shooting phase instead of firing a weapon. Place the small Blast marker over any enemy unit not locked in close combat within 12&quot; of the Librarian then Scatter D6&quot;. Any model hit by the Blast marker must roll equal to or under their Initiative characteristic on a D6 (A 6 is always a failure) or they will be sucked into the depths of the Warp and be destroyed instantly without a save of any kind!</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="10.0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink id="7e48-4717-60bc-3725" name="Space Marine Vehicle Upgrades" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" targetId="93a4-c4f2-3183-a640" type="selectionEntryGroup"/>
