            <rule id="68df-e8f4-4b23-ca36" name="Familiar" hidden="false">
              <description>A Librarian with a Familiar gains a +1 to Initiative and allows the purchase of an additional Major Psychic Power (At an increased cost). Familiars count as the same troop type as the libarian and do not take up any space in a transport. If the Librarian is removed from play, the Familiar is also removed.</description>
